#ASSERT `s 188(6) the judge may at the same time issue the related warrant or make the related order` (`Provision of the Code` OF 487.01 , "") TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 188(6) the judge may at the same time issue the related warrant or make the related order` (`Provision of the Code` OF 487.01 , "") TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
